        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Graveyard 404, a first-person psychological horror game where your observation skills are your only weapon against a living nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught in a repeating death loop within a haunted graveyard, you must meticulously scan your surroundings for anomalies—anything out of place—to find the path forward. Succeed, and you might escape. Fail, and the nightmare resets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras/7774f8b6259cd0b3008b87e2253ae96e.avif?t=1755832279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras_big/7774f8b6259cd0b3008b87e2253ae96e.avif?t=1755832279 width=1600 height=900 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras/08cf09029400e0c9aa862d96f5d03933.avif?t=1755832279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras_big/08cf09029400e0c9aa862d96f5d03933.avif?t=1755832279 width=1600 height=900 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras/33d8c6ef0b43e0e36709c5a673b5bc58.avif?t=1755832279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras_big/33d8c6ef0b43e0e36709c5a673b5bc58.avif?t=1755832279 width=1600 height=900 /></span><br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spot the Difference to Survive:</strong> This isn't just a walking simulator. Your core task is to identify over 32 unique and unsettling anomalies, from misplaced objects to otherworldly intruders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the Death Loop:</strong> The graveyard repeats, but small changes offer a way out. Successfully report all anomalies in a cycle to progress. Miss one, and you're back at the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Ritualistic Puzzles:</strong> Finding an anomaly is only the first step. You must locate and use items like incense to perform the correct ritual and cleanse the evil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices and success rate will lead to one of 5 different endings. Replay to discover them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Dread, No Jumpscares:</strong> The terror builds from the oppressive atmosphere and sound design, not cheap startling tricks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Focused Horror Experience:</strong> A single playthrough lasts between 30-90 minutes, perfect for a concentrated dose of horror.</p></li></ul>",
