all changes offer a way out. Successfully report all anomalies in a cycle to progress. Miss one, and you're back at the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Ritualistic Puzzles:</strong> Finding an anomaly is only the first step. You must locate and use items like incense to perform the correct ritual and cleanse the evil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices and success rate will lead to one of 5 different endings. Replay to discover them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Dread, No Jumpscares:</strong> The terror builds from the oppressive atmosphere and sound design, not cheap startling tricks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Focused Horror Experience:</strong> A single playthrough lasts between 30-90 minutes, perfect for a concentrated dose of horror.</p></li></ul>",
